1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,044
If Q is less than K s p, the solution is unsaturated, and more solid would dissolve.

2
00:00:07,044 --> 00:00:11,419
If Q equals K s p, it is exactly saturated.

3
00:00:11,419 --> 00:00:19,505
If Q is greater, it is supersaturated, and the salt precipitates until Q falls back down to K s p.

